 --> tests/ui/types/stderr_output_misuse.science:8:5
  |
8 |     print_error("rows:", 3)
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ 2 arguments were supplied
  |
  = note: interpolate instead: `print_error(f"… {value}")`

error[SC0275]: `write_error` takes one value
 --> tests/ui/types/stderr_output_misuse.science:9:5
  |
9 |     write_error()
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ 0 arguments were supplied
  |
  = note: a blank line is `write_error("")`: there are no default arguments (§4.4)

error[SC0527]: this call takes 0 arguments and was given 1
